      "get": {
        "description": "TASK-073: real Keycloak Authorization Code+PKCE flow — redirects the browser into Keycloak's `/realms/jimesh/protocol/openid-connect/auth` (frontend just navigates here, `auth-gate.tsx`). Google/GitHub identity-provider brokering is fully wired (`deploy/keycloak/jimesh-realm.json` — client IDs/secrets via `GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID`/`GITHUB_CLIENT_ID` env vars, mappers, claims chain) but ships **`\"enabled\": false`** — a provider without real operator-supplied credentials must not render a dead login button (No-Mock mandate); activation steps for a fresh or already-running deployment are in `deploy/keycloak/README.md`",
        "operationId": "get_api_auth_oidc_login",
        "responses": {
